# Mobile build configuration — loaded by `vite build --mode mobile` (npm run build:mobile).
#
# IMPORTANT: every VITE_* value is PUBLIC. Vite inlines it into the shipped app bundle, so NEVER
# put a secret (OAuth client secret, API key, admin token, DB password) here. Secrets belong in the
# backend environment only.
#
# A native app has no same-origin nginx proxy, so it cannot use a relative "/api" origin — it must
# point at your DEPLOYED production API over HTTPS.
#
# This file intentionally ships an UNSET value. `npm run build:mobile` runs a preflight
# (scripts/check-mobile-env.mjs) that FAILS the build if VITE_API_BASE is missing, still a
# placeholder, or not https — so a store build can never silently ship pointing at nothing.
#
# Set it for a real build without editing this file (keeps the value out of git):
#   VITE_API_BASE=https://api.yourdomain.com/api npm run build:mobile
#
# Note this file IS tracked in git, so do not paste anything you would not publish.
VITE_API_BASE=
